<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>FAQs - EDUVoice</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="dashboard-body">
  <main class="simple-page">
    <a class="simple-back-link" href="/dashboard">← Back to dashboard</a>
    <section class="simple-card faq-card">
      <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I submit feedback?</summary>
        <p>Choose “Submit Suggestion”, complete the form with a category, title, location, and description, then submit it.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How can I check the status of my submission?</summary>
        <p>Open “My Feedback” from the dashboard. Select a submission title to view its details and latest status.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I submit feedback anonymously?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Select the anonymous option on the submission form. Your feedback can still be reviewed by the campus team.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What do the status labels mean?</summary>
        <p>Submitted means it is received, Under Review or In Progress means it is being handled, and Resolved or Closed means work is complete.</p>
      </details>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
